<title>PHILIPPINES: Metro Pacific net up in first three qtrs.</title>
<headline>Metro Pacific net up in first three qtrs.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>Earnings per share (centavos)  18.06 vs 12.03</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)		 3.962 vs 3.755</p>
<p>    Net income			 590.528 vs 305.238</p>
<p>Note: Full name Metro Pacific Corp. Company is the Philippine flagship of Hong Kong-based First Pacific Holdings.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
